<title>CANADA: Thunder Bay vessel clearances - April 2.</title>
<headline>Thunder Bay vessel clearances - April 2.</headline>
<text>
<p>Daily vessel clearances at Thunder Bay, Ontario:</p>
<p> Date	Vessel		Cargo (Tonnes) Destination</p>
<p>April 1  H.M. Griffith	26,200 wheat    St.Lawrence Ports</p>
<p>NOTE: Thunder Bay closed its shipping season December 27 when the Mapleglen cleared and reopened April 1 when the H.M. Griffith cleared. Source: Lake Shippers Clearance Assn. M=meal,P=pellets,O=oil</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
